<body data-time="all">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar"><a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a><nav class="navlinks" id="navlinks"><a href="/#how">How it works</a><a href="/method/">The method</a><a href="/the-360/">The 360</a><a href="/the-180/">The 180</a><a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/#russ">About Russ</a><a href="/speaking/">Speaking</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin</a></nav><button class="navtoggle" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-controls="navlinks" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
      <p class="eyebrow">How we coach</p>
      <h1>One method. <em>Your whole life.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Most coaching picks one thing: your habits, your mindset, your body, your money. We don't think a life comes in pieces. So we built a method that doesn't either.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin with Russ</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#lists">See what it's built from</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What makes it different</p><h2>Integrative. Holistic. Human.</h2><p class="lede">Three words that get used loosely. Here is exactly what we mean by them.</p></div>
      <div class="pains">
        <div class="pain"><h3>Integrative</h3><p>We studied the whole field: 360 ways people have tried to become whole, from ancient scripture to modern psychology. Then we built the method that brings the best of them together, in an order that works, with a coach to walk it with you.</p></div>
        <div class="pain"><h3>Holistic</h3><p>Mind and body are one year, not two programs. 360 keys for the mind. 180 for the body, each one a way to turn it around: fuel, fitness, sleep, breath, rest. The same morning, the same coach, the same notebook.</p></div>
        <div class="pain"><h3>Human</h3><p>Vault is the action. Human is the person. Every night you write three lines, and your coach knows your story. The method works because someone walks it with you.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="why"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Why 360 and 180</p><h2>Everything that has ever helped a person, in one year.</h2></div>
      <div class="two" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px">
        <div class="row" style="background:var(--dark2);border-radius:10px;padding:26px"><h3 style="color:#fff">The 360 · the Mind Vault</h3><p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:10px">Three hundred and sixty teachings, each sourced to a named teacher, text or tradition. Psychology and recovery. Mystics, poets and sages. Scripture from the Abrahamic, Indian, East Asian, Indigenous and ancient worlds. Leadership and work. The body, the breath, the nervous system. Habits and performance. Each one has a date, an author, and a reason it made the list. We did not leave the spiritual out to be safe. It is the largest part.</p></div>
        <div class="row" style="background:var(--dark2);border-radius:10px;padding:26px"><h3 style="color:#fff">The 180 · the Body Vault</h3><p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:10px">A 180 is a reversal. These are one hundred and eighty ways a body has been turned around: fed, trained, rested and healed. Modern protocols with trial evidence. Ancient and traditional medicine. The foodways and fasts of living religions. Strength, endurance, mobility, sleep, heat and cold, sobriety. Every other day, one of them, with the walk and the table as the two that never change.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="constant" style="margin-top:34px">Four verbs hold the year: <span style="color:var(--acc)">Learn</span> · <span style="color:var(--acc)">Love</span> · <span style="color:var(--acc)">Live</span> · <span style="color:var(--acc)">Listen</span></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How the year moves</p><h2>Eleven chambers. Nine gates. One key a day.</h2><p class="lede">Think of the year as a house. You walk it one chamber at a time. A key is a sourced teaching; it turns when the habit holds. Turned keys open the gate to the next chamber, not the calendar.</p></div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step"><div class="n">1–5</div><h3>Our order</h3><p>Months one to five. You, Body, Awareness, Meaning, Healing: the chambers that ground a person as a self. Everyone walks these first, in our order.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="n">6</div><h3>The rest</h3><p>Month six. No new keys. You keep the walk and the table, and you write. This is where most programs fail; it is where ours turns.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="n">7–12</div><h3>Your order</h3><p>Months seven to twelve. Circle, Rhythm, Freedom, Tomorrow, Service, Sharing: the chambers that ground a person as more than a self. You choose the order within each. Your own tradition is welcome back here.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="human"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The human part</p><h2>Vault is the action.<br>Human is the person.</h2><p class="lede">Every lesson ends with one small thing to do, and every night ends with three lines in your own hand. Those lines are read by a person, not a model. That is the whole difference between information and coaching, and it is the part we will not automate.</p></div>
      <div class="pains">
        <div class="pain"><h3>A real reader</h3><p>Your coach reads your notes before your session. Nothing you write disappears into a dashboard.</p></div>
        <div class="pain"><h3>A real circle</h3><p>Six people, once a week, who are walking the same rooms. Listening is the fourth verb for a reason.</p></div>
        <div class="pain"><h3>A real tradition</h3><p>We do not replace your faith or your practice. The second half of the year is built so it can come back in, as your own choice.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="lists"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">See the whole thing</p><h2>The lists are open to you.</h2><p class="lede">We are not hiding the curriculum. Every teaching and every protocol is named, dated and explained. Read them. Argue with them. Then start.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc green" href="/the-360/"><div class="when">Mind · heart · spirit</div><h3>The 360</h3><p>Every teaching, by category, with its source and the one line that says what it asks of you.</p><span>Read the 360 →</span></a><a class="tlc brown" href="/the-180/"><div class="when">Fuel · fitness · rest</div><h3>The 180</h3><p>Every protocol and tradition, by category, with its source and what it asks of your body.</p><span>Read the 180 →</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="#" data-open-form><div class="when">Day one</div><h3>Begin</h3><p>Your first key tomorrow at 7 a.m., then one each morning. Your first week is on us.</p><span>Begin with Russ →</span></a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final"><div class="wrap">
      <h2>One method. Your whole life.</h2><p class="lede">Begin tonight, and your first key is in your inbox at 7 a.m.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Begin with Russ</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/#pricing">See pricing</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="site"><div class="wrap foot">
    <div><a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a><p>Daily coaching with Russ Michaels.</p><p><a href="mailto:vault@vaulthuman.com">vault@vaulthuman.com</a> · <a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p></div>
    <ul><li><a href="/method/">The method</a></li><li><a href="/the-360/">The 360 · mind</a></li><li><a href="/the-180/">The 180 · body</a></li><li><a href="/as-learned/">As Learned</a></li><li><a href="/as-loved/">As Loved</a></li><li><a href="/as-lived/">As Lived</a></li><li><a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a></li><li><a href="/writing">Writing</a></li><li><a href="/speaking/">Speaking</a></li></ul>
    <ul><li><a href="https://www.fretworksystems.com">Fretwork Systems</a> — automation for businesses</li><li><a href="https://triplicityadvisory.com">Triplicity Advisory</a> — executive and leadership coaching</li><li><a href="https://www.tercetlaw.com">Tercet Law</a> — wills, trusts, succession</li></ul>
  </div><div class="wrap legal"><span>&copy; {year} Vault Human, LLC. Coaching is not legal, medical, financial or therapeutic advice.</span><span>Learn · Love · Live · Listen</span></div></footer>
  <div id="vh-modal" class="vh-modal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="vh-modal__bg" data-close-form></div><div class="vh-modal__card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Begin your year with Russ"><button class="vh-modal__x" type="button" data-close-form aria-label="Close">&times;</button><h2 class="vh-modal__title">Begin your year with Russ</h2><p class="vh-modal__sub">Tell us a little about you. Russ will write back personally, and tomorrow at 7 a.m. your first key arrives: a short teaching and one small practice to start your first chamber. Your first week is on us.</p><div class="hs-form-frame" data-region="na2" data-form-id="3f225ab5-5a70-46d9-a497-29e6256b1e52" data-portal-id="246947446"></div></div></div>
  <script is:inline src="https://js-na2.hsforms.net/forms/embed/246947446.js" defer></script>
  <script is:inline>
  (function(){var m=document.getElementById('vh-modal');if(!m)return;function o(e){if(e)e.preventDefault();m.classList.add('is-open');m.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');document.documentElement.style.overflow='hidden';}function c(){m.classList.remove('is-open');m.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');document.documentElement.style.overflow='';}document.addEventListener('click',function(e){var t=e.target.closest('[data-open-form]');if(t){o(e);return;}if(e.target.closest('[data-close-form]'))c();});document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){if(e.key==='Escape')c();});})();
  addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){document.body.classList.add('ready');if(!('IntersectionObserver'in window))return;var e=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.sec .wrap > *'));e.forEach(function(x){x.classList.add('reveal')});var o=new IntersectionObserver(function(t){t.forEach(function(y){if(y.isIntersecting){y.target.classList.add('in');o.unobserve(y.target)}})},{threshold:0.08,rootMargin:'0px 0px -30px 0px'});e.forEach(function(x){o.observe(x)});});
  </script>
<script is:inline>(function(){var b=document.querySelector(".navtoggle"),n=document.getElementById("navlinks");if(!b||!n)return;function set(o){document.body.classList.toggle("nav-open",o);b.setAttribute("aria-expanded",o?"true":"false");b.setAttribute("aria-label",o?"Close menu":"Open menu");}b.addEventListener("click",function(){set(!document.body.classList.contains("nav-open"));});n.addEventListener("click",function(e){if(e.target.closest("a"))set(false);});document.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){if(e.key==="Escape")set(false);});})();</script>
<div class="dk-pop" id="dk-pop" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="dk-pop__bg" data-dk-close></div>
  <div class="dk-pop__card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="dk-pop-title">
    <button class="dk-pop__x" type="button" data-dk-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    <svg class="dk-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M32 6v7M32 51v7M6 32h7M51 32h7M13.6 13.6l5 5M45.4 45.4l5 5M13.6 50.4l5-5M45.4 18.6l5-5"/><circle cx="26" cy="32" r="7"/><path d="M33 32h16M44 32v5M48 32v4"/></g></svg>
    <h2 class="dk-title" id="dk-pop-title">The Daily Key</h2>
    <p class="dk-sub">Free guidance from Russ in your inbox, five mornings a week. One short teaching, one small practice.</p>
    <form class="dk-form" novalidate><label class="dk-sr" for="dk-email-pop">Email</label><input id="dk-email-pop" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" autocomplete="email" required /><button type="submit">Subscribe</button></form>
    <p class="dk-fine">Free. Unsubscribe any time. We never share your email.</p>
    <p class="dk-msg" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
</div>
<script is:inline>
(function(){
  if(window.__dkInit)return;window.__dkInit=true;
  var URL='https://api.hsforms.com/submissions/v3/integration/submit/246947446/3f225ab5-5a70-46d9-a497-29e6256b1e52';
  function get(k){try{return localStorage.getItem(k)}catch(e){return null}}
  function put(k,v){try{localStorage.setItem(k,v)}catch(e){}}
  function bind(){
    document.querySelectorAll('.dk-form').forEach(function(f){
      if(f.__b)return;f.__b=true;
      f.addEventListener('submit',function(e){
        e.preventDefault();var inp=f.querySelector('input'),msg=f.parentNode.querySelector('.dk-msg'),btn=f.querySelector('button');
        var v=(inp.value||'').trim();
        if(!/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]{2,}$/.test(v)){msg.textContent='Please enter a valid email address.';inp.focus();return;}
        btn.disabled=true;msg.textContent='Sending…';
        fetch(URL,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({fields:[{name:'email',value:v},{name:'message',value:'Daily Key subscriber'}],context:{pageUri:location.href,pageName:'Daily Key signup · '+document.title}})})
        .then(function(r){if(!r.ok)throw 0;put('dk_sub','1');f.style.display='none';msg.textContent='You’re in. Your first key arrives tomorrow morning.';try{gtag('event','sign_up',{method:'daily_key'})}catch(_){};})
        .catch(function(){btn.disabled=false;msg.innerHTML='That didn’t go through. Try again, or write to <a href="mailto:vault@vaulthuman.com">vault@vaulthuman.com</a>.';});
      });
    });
  }
  function init(){
    bind();
    var p=document.getElementById('dk-pop');if(!p)return;
    function open(){if(get('dk_sub'))return;var last=+get('dk_seen')||0;if(Date.now()-last<14*864e5)return;var m=document.getElementById('vh-modal');if(m&&m.classList.contains('is-open'))return;if(document.body.classList.contains('nav-open'))return;put('dk_seen',String(Date.now()));p.classList.add('is-open');p.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');}
    function close(){p.classList.remove('is-open');p.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');}
    p.addEventListener('click',function(e){if(e.target.closest('[data-dk-close]'))close();});
    document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){if(e.key==='Escape')close();});
    var t=setTimeout(open,30000);
    addEventListener('scroll',function s(){var h=document.documentElement;if((h.scrollTop+innerHeight)/h.scrollHeight>0.55){removeEventListener('scroll',s);clearTimeout(t);open();}},{passive:true});
    document.addEventListener('mouseout',function(e){if(!e.relatedTarget&&e.clientY<=0)open();});
  }
  if(document.readyState==='loading')document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',init);else init();
})();
</script>
</body></html>
